  "reasoning": "Turn 4 failed because the model made exploratory tool calls (get_user_id, list_users) instead of directly invoking send_message with the provided identifiers. The user explicitly provided sender ID 'USR100145' and receiver ID 'travel_advisor', making these lookups unnecessary and violating the delta3 principle.",
